        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IDLE SHOOTER</strong> is a unique hybrid of idle and arcade shooter games. Destroy countless blocks to collect ten different currencies. Purchase various upgrades to increase your earnings and firepower. Use the prestige system to acquire powerful permanent upgrades. Purchase extra idle turrets to farm more efficiently, or invest in fully passive mining income!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with just a few blocks and a small income. Gradually unlock new features and manage resources strategically to maximize your profits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive 2D arcade shooter with complex idle-game mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of upgrades and ten different currencies. Choose your own build!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prestige system with basic but necessary upgrades. No instant progress reset!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IDLE TURRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in idle helpers if you prefer a more relaxing gameplay style. Purchase upgrades and see turrets work for you! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINING AND TRADING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more ways to farm currencies! Invest in fully passive mining or trade your excess currencies on the market.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STATS AND ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed in-game statistics to track all your accomplishments and a lot of Steam achievements to unlock.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IDLE SHOOTER</strong> is a unique hybrid of idle and arcade shooter games. Destroy countless blocks to collect ten different currencies. Purchase various upgrades to increase your earnings and firepower. Use the prestige system to acquire powerful permanent upgrades. Purchase extra idle turrets to farm more efficiently, or invest in fully passive mining income!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with just a few blocks and a small income. Gradually unlock new features and manage resources strategically to maximize your profits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive 2D arcade shooter with complex idle-game mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of upgrades and ten different currencies. Choose your own build!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prestige system with basic but necessary upgrades. No instant progress reset!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IDLE TURRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in idle helpers if you prefer a more relaxing gameplay style. Purchase upgrades and see turrets work for you! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINING AND TRADING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more ways to farm currencies! Invest in fully passive mining or trade your excess currencies on the market.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STATS AND ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed in-game statistics to track all your accomplishments and a lot of Steam achievements to unlock.</p>",
